xt{-}reaping\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ReapingFamily}_S(\\mathcal{R}) \\leftrightarrow \\mathcal{R}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\land\\forall R\\in\\mathcal R\\;\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(R)\\land\\forall X\\subseteq\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(X)\\to\\exists R\\in\\mathcal R\\;(\\mathrm{Finite}(R\\cap X)\\lor\\mathrm{Finite}(R\\setminus X))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}reaping\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ReapingFamily}_S(\\mathcal{R}) \\leftrightarrow \\mathcal{R}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\land\\forall R\\in\\mathcal R\\;\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(R)\\land\\forall X\\subseteq\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(X)\\to\\exists R\\in\\mathcal R\\;(\\mathrm{Finite}(R\\cap X)\\lor\\mathrm{Finite}(R\\setminus X))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}$ is the finite-set predicate (see [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{R}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ReapingFamily}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}reaping\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ReapingFamily}_S(\\mathcal{R}) \\leftrightarrow \\mathcal{R}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\land\\forall R\\in\\mathcal R\\;\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(R)\\land\\forall X\\subseteq\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(X)\\to\\exists R\\in\\mathcal R\\;(\\mathrm{Finite}(R\\cap X)\\lor\\mathrm{Finite}(R\\setminus X))\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":906,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3223","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-reaping-family.md|58-df-zfc-reaping-family]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d9a25b0ac94a3598"]}